Subject: [PATCH] fixup: Leaves: Lithium Sleeping Block Entity

This is a temp patch for tracking new changes added in Lithium that Leaves haven't updated yet.
This patch will merge into Leaves once they finish the 26.x update, and sync back to Leaf,
(merge into original patch).

Last checked Lithium commit: 11ea08adce6f94627d3eaaa65506a60e0451c8b6

The base patch owns the shared inventory-listener API and 26.3 signature changes.
This fixup owns sculk sleeping, ticker rebinding, comparator checks, listener
unsubscription, furnace inventory wakeups, and forced-vibration wakeups.
The calibrated sculk sensor now has its own ticker and is covered here too.

Additional 26.3 sources checked:
* "net/caffeinemc/mods/lithium/mixin/world/block_entity_ticking/sleeping/furnace/AbstractFurnaceBlockEntityMixin.java"
